        send title "&aPrzedmiot uzyty!" with subtitle "&aUżyles &x&5&f&d&3&e&b&lꜱ&x&6&2&d&4&e&b&lɪ&x&6&6&d&4&e&b&lᴇ&x&6&9&d&5&e&b&lʀ&x&6&d&d&5&e&b&lꜱ&x&7&0&d&6&e&b&lᴄ&x&7&3&d&6&e&b&l &x&7&7&d&7&e&b&lɴ&x&7&a&d&7&e&b&lɪ&x&7&e&d&8&e&b&lᴇ&x&8&1&d&8&e&b&lᴅ&x&8&4&d&9&e&b&lᴢ&x&8&8&d&9&e&b&lᴡ&x&8&b&d&a&e&b&lɪ&x&8&f&d&b&e&b&lᴇ&x&9&2&d&b&e&a&lᴅ&x&9&5&d&c&e&a&lᴢ&x&9&9&d&c&e&a&lɪ&x&9&c&d&d&e&a&lᴀ&x&9&f&d&d&e&a&l &x&a&3&d&e&e&a&lᴘ&x&a&6&d&e&e&a&lᴏ&x&a&a&d&f&e&a&lʟ&x&a&d&d&f&e&a&lᴀ&x&b&0&e&0&e&a&lʀ&x&b&4&e&0&e&a&lɴ&x&b&7&e&1&e&a&lᴇ&x&b&b&e&1&e&a&lᴢ&x&b&e&e&2&e&a&lᴏ" 
        set item cooldown of player's tool for player to {@cooldown} seconds
        set {cd.%uuid of player%.futro} to now + {@cooldown} seconds
